# ── User Assignments ──────────────────────────────────────
#
# Maps users to the machines they can access.
# - If a user IS listed: they can only use the machines in their list.
# - If a user is NOT listed: they get any available floating machine.
# - Machines referenced here are removed from the floating pool.
# - Multiple users can share the same machines.
#
# assignments:
#
#   # Dedicated — one user, one machine
#   randy.mcentee: [dxs-flame-01]
#
#   # Restricted pool — user picks from these 3
#   jane.doe: [dxs-flame-01, dxs-flame-02, dxs-flame-03]
#
#   # Shared pool — bob and jane both have access to flame-02 and flame-03
#   bob.smith: [dxs-flame-02, dxs-flame-03]
#
#   # Unassigned users (not listed) get any machine NOT referenced above.
#   # In this example, flame-04, flame-05, flame-06 would be floating.
